"🦫 held for the radio
   ├─ a a → ehmpathy/rhachet
   │  ├─ state: set aside (upstream:auth)
   │  ├─ amend it: rhx radio.task.queue set --key a --auth as-human (needs a gh login on this host)
   │  └─ or drop it: rhx radio.task.queue del --key a --why "<why>"
   ├─ b b → ehmpathy/rhachet
   │  ├─ state: set aside (upstream:auth)
   │  ├─ amend it: rhx radio.task.queue set --key b --auth as-human (needs a gh login on this host)
   │  └─ or drop it: rhx radio.task.queue del --key b --why "<why>"
   ├─ c c → ehmpathy/rhachet
   │  ├─ state: held at gate (radio.uses:blocked — global)
   │  └─ lift it (human): rhx radio.uses --global allow
   └─ then the next push, or \`rhx radio.task.queue drain\`, delivers the backlog"
`;

